s-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#E0D8C8]"></span><p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Platform Metrics — View live data on the operational platform</p><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#E0D8C8]"></span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">Communities Connected</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">Households Served</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5A623]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap text-[#F5A623]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#F5A623]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">Clean kWh Shared</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#8DC63F]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-leaf text-[#71A030]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#71A030]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">kg CO₂ Avoided</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wifi text-[#3BAF4A]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h.01"></path><path d="M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0"></path><path d="M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"></path><path d="M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0"></path></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#3BAF4A]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">Nodes Online Now</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F7F4] px-4 py-5 ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5A623]/8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up text-[#F5A623]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#F5A623]">—</p><p class="mt-1 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#9EB09F]">Grid Uptime</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F5F0E8] px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">How It Works</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Three principles. One fair grid.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Grid Ubuntu isn&#x27;t just hardware. It&#x27;s an operating model — designed so that the more households that join, the cheaper and more resilient the system becomes for everyone.</p></div><div class="grid gap-px bg-[#E0D8C8] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-white p-8"><p class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none" style="color:#F5A623">01</p><h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Shared Infrastructure</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5A6E5C]">One solar installation. One battery bank. Shared by the entire community — bringing the per-household cost to a fraction of an individual rooftop system.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8"><p class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none" style="color:#3BAF4A">02</p><h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Intelligent Enforcement</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5A6E5C]">The EMS engine monitors every watt in real time. If a household exceeds its limit, the relay trips automatically — protecting the shared reserves for everyone else.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8"><p class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none" style="color:#8DC63F">03</p><h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Tokenised Equity</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5A6E5C]">Pre-paid kWh tokens purchased via EcoCash ensure guaranteed baseline access for lighting, charging, and small appliances — no bank account required.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">The Human Impact</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-[#1A2B1C]">A child studying at midnight<br/>is not a small thing.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">When a household joins Grid Ubuntu, the immediate visible change is a light bulb. The real change is compounding: children study longer, shops stay open later, kerosene disappears from kitchens, families stay connected to health services, and local businesses expand their operating hours.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">This is transformation measured in human dignity — not just kilowatt-hours.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#1A2B1C] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A2B1C] transition hover:bg-[#1A2B1C] hover:text-white" href="/impact">Read the Full Impact Story <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F0E8] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E0D8C8]"><span class="text-2xl">📚</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">School hours extended</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#9EB09F]">Reliable evening light for study sessions beyond sunset</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F0E8] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E0D8C8]"><span class="text-2xl">🏪</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Shops open longer</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#9EB09F]">Local businesses powered through evening trade peaks</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F0E8] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E0D8C8]"><span class="text-2xl">🌿</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Kerosene eliminated</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#9EB09F]">Clean energy replaces hazardous indoor fossil fuels</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F0E8] p-6 ring-1 ring-[#E0D8C8]"><span class="text-2xl">💊</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Healthcare access</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#9EB09F]">Phones charged — emergency lines and health apps stay online</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-[#E0D8C8] bg-[#F5F0E8] px-6 py-14"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Partners &amp; Recognition</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-white px-10 py-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E0D8C8]"><div class="relative h-14 w-32"><img alt="POTRAZ" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="object-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" src="/potraz-logo.jpg"/></div><div class="text-center"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">POTRAZ</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#9EB09F]">Regulatory Partner</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-[#E0D8C8] bg-white px-10 py-6"><div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F0E8] text-2xl">🌍</div><div class="text-center"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Your Organisation?</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#9EB09F] max-w-[140px]">We welcome NGO, impact finance &amp; development partners</p></div><a class="rounded-xl bg-[#3BAF4A] px-4 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#2D9039]" href="/contact">Partner With Us</a></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#0E2A10] px-6 py-24 text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><p class="mb-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">For NGOs, Funders &amp; Development Partners</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight lg:text-4xl">The infrastructure gap in rural Africa<br/>is a <span style="color:#F5A623">software problem.</span></h2><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We have built the system. We are proving it works. If your mandate is equitable energy access and you have the resources to help us scale, we want to hear from you.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><a class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5A623] px-8 py-4 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C] shadow-lg shadow-[#F5A623]/20 transition hover:bg-[#D97706]" href="/contact">Start a Conversation</a><a class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10" href="/product">See the Technology</a></div></div></section>